    "description": {
      "content": "Zayo offers free APIs to help make doing business with Zayo easier. The world is shifting from user-led interfaces to system-to-system integration through application programming interfaces.  Zayo, your trusted digital transformation partner, is ready to help. Seamless integration to Zayo’s Customer Portal responds to the growing need for automation. Discover how to expand your network, get quotes, order quotes, and manage your network with our Ticketing and Maintenance Cases API.    \n\nContact Support:\n Name: Zayo API Team\n Email: zayoapi@zayo.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
